ion count is largely definitional (steal starts a break).\n- observed_sample_and_power: n=911968; MADE_DEAD n=354564\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPS-075\n- observed_verdict: descriptive"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-088", "score": 0.101, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-088 | Study family SF-APPS-088: Offensive-identity resilience: connector absence vs usage-matched others\n- observed_research_question: Offensive-identity resilience: connector absence vs usage-matched others\n- auto_outcome_status: supported\n- observed_hypothesis: Connector absence displaces team offensive identity (D_A) more than usage-matched non-organizer absence.\n- observed_result: Unmatched conn vs role D_A 0.2020 vs 0.1021, t=5.97 p=2.87e-08. Usage-matched vs role: paired dD_A +0.1151, P(conn>ctrl)=81.2%, t=6.35 p=7.35e-09 n=96. Vs terminal: +0.0777 t=2.37 p=0.0261 n=25.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: D_positive (no failure: positive result)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:MECHANICAL_FLOOR\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: Usage-matched connector vs role occupant identity break is large and significant (n=96). Licensed comparison excludes organizers.\n- observed_sample_and_power: n=96 matched pairs vs role; n=25 vs terminal; 908 player-seasons\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-PAP-014"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-067", "score": 0.088, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-067 | Study family SF-APPS-067: Opponent action T -> your offense T+1 (def-matched 8x8)\n- observed_research_question: Opponent action T -> your offense T+1 (def-matched 8x8)\n- auto_outcome_status: supported\n- observed_hypothesis: The opponent's previous play type changes your next-possession PPP after matching on defensive team.\n- observed_result: 3/64 FINDING cells survive both matchings: SPOT_UP->TRANSITION ATT=-0.085; POST_UP->TRANSITION -0.083; PNR->DRIVE -0.058 (all also survive +prev_made). PULL_UP->DRIVE dropped as defense-quality confound.\n- auto_failure_mechanism: D_positive (no failure: positive result)\n- observed_failure_evidence: Three cells replicate under def-match, off-match, and prev_made control. Most of 64 are null.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 64 cells tested; 3 FINDING\n- auto_validation_status: same_pipeline_validation; evidence: APPS-067: 'matching primary; sensitivity match on own offense. bh-fdr+placebo+ft-clean. prev_made control. 3/64 finding cells survive bot'\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPS-060"}], "n_results": 4}

